\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 存在无限模型；模型、论域与基数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"||\\mathfrak A||\">\\(||\\mathfrak A||\\)</span> 表示论域基数。紧致性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ba2923371a2ce5ea\" href=\"?note=ba2923371a2ce5ea\" title=\"57-thm-compactness\">57-thm-compactness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\Phi\\land||\\mathfrak A||\\geq\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\Phi\\land||\\mathfrak A||\\geq\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>添加 kappa 个两两不同的新常量；每个有限部分的可满足性来自原模型无限，而非来自句子集这个类型本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}